      "id": "parsnips-roasted-prep",
      "dishId": "parsnips-roasted",
      "summary": "Prepare the parsnips",
      "instruction": "Peel the parsnips and cut them into batons — quarter them lengthways, then halve the quarters if they are thick. If the parsnips have a large woody core, cut it out. Try to keep the pieces a similar size for even cooking.",
