      "id": "parsnips-roasted-roast",
      "dishId": "parsnips-roasted",
      "summary": "Roast the parsnips",
      "instruction": "Place the tray in the oven at 190°C fan. Roast for 30–35 minutes, turning once halfway through, until the parsnips are golden brown and tender with crispy edges. The honey will help them caramelise beautifully. They should be soft inside and golden outside.",
